rizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Ruby\"><img alt=\"Small Ruby\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Small_Ruby_5305df.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Pearl\"><img alt=\"White Pearl\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/White_Pearl_d0ee7e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Turtle%20Shell\"><img alt=\"Turtle Shell\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Turtle_Shell_387b15.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Map lagunaislands\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"89\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Map_lagunaislands_2702e0.jpg\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">7.8<br/>August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places and Loot <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThere are three small tropical islands south-east of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Shattered%20Isles\">Shattered Isles</a>, these are known as the Laguna Islands. They haven't own names, they are just called Laguna Islands as a group.\n</p><p>The Laguna Islands are rich in vegetation, but are also densely populated with some dangerous wildlife. The palm trees and long sandy beaches are home to many protective amphibians like <a href=\"#/wiki/Toad\">Toads</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Tortoise\">Tortoises</a> and all kinds of small frogs. There is also a small village of <a href=\"#/wiki/Amazon\">Amazons</a> on the smallest island.\n</p><p>There are no ports on the Laguna Islands, but some sea creatures know where they are and how to get there.\n</p><p>There are Sea Turtles that will transport you between the islands, but only if you have <a href=\"#/quest/the-shattered-isles-quest\">permission</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\nA good tip for <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a> is to summon 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Monks\">Monks</a> and just hunt everything there.<br/>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Hunting with a monk\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"194\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Laguna_Monk_ea8f43.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></span><br/>\n<br/>\nA knight can easily hunt here with 60/60 skills, a good weapon with 35+ attack from level 20, but usage of <a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potion\">health potions</a> may be needed.  It is a very common knight hunting place due to high experience and profit for relatively low risk.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Laguna Island NPCs (1 NPC)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Erayo\">Erayo</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Erayo\"><img alt=\"Erayo\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Erayo_1f7981.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Assassin</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">North-East on <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Laguna Islands</strong> in a hammock, one level down.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Ground_Levels\">Ground Levels</span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Laguna Island Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Amazon\"><img alt=\"Amazon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Amazon_40